  "title": "Tamil Nadu's Contempt Notice and Karthigai Deepam Controversy",
  "summary": "The Supreme Court in India issued a contempt notice to Tamil Nadu officials for violating the November 20 Karthigai Deepam order, citing a pre-meditated conspiracy between the state and temple authorities. This incident highlights ongoing tensions between political leaders and religious institutions.",
